5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The current system is failing. We need a clear, cost-effective structure for the coming year.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree the current setup is unsustainable. Before we pick a structure, we need accurate data on actual time spent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the urgency, but let’s not guess. We need to verify if the workload is actually skewed before we blame the system.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,You’re all so serious. I just want to walk into the bathroom without holding my breath. Can we make that the priority?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I hear you, May. Let’s keep the tone light. I’m worried about us clashing later. Can we focus on harmony first?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@May, your point is valid. @Ryuji, timing data is useful, but I need to track the recurring costs of supplies to see who is actually paying.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, costs matter, but time is the bottleneck. I need to measure the actual duration of a full cleaning pass to see the real load.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, timing is good, but I need to know who’s actually here. I’ll check the wall calendar absences and what each of us counts as done.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, checking absences is smart. I’ll look into the bathroom spray stock and the grout condition to see why it’s so gross.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the house chat rows and the previous tenants’ note. I want to understand our history and what worked before.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, tracking absences is wise. I will examine the management office rate sheet and the outside firm’s standard terms to compare costs.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
