19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@May, I hope it’s just funny, not painful. I’m curious what the previous tenants left behind.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll review the management office rate sheet and the outside firm’s standard terms. This will clarify the financial baseline for our decision.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
